{"title":"Murim’s Debt King","synopsis":"Tempat di mana uang dibutuhkan untuk menempa satu pedang, untuk memberi makan dan pakaian kepada murid-muridmu—tidak, bahkan hanya untuk bernapas. Murim.\n\n\n\nApa kau butuh uang? Apa peringkat kreditmu turun? Datanglah ke Bank Kontinental. Pinjaman tanpa jaminan, persetujuan di hari yang sama.\n\n\n\nKau bilang kau tidak punya uang untuk membayarnya kembali? Ah. Jangan khawatir. Kami juga menerima pembayaran dengan tubuhmu. Tenang! Kau akan menderita cedera internal jika terus tegang!\n\n\n\nTerima kasih atas bisnis Anda, pelanggan yang terhormat!","alternative_title":"무림사채왕","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"3ccc599b-ebae-4da3-8f30-660683c8f571","number":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"2a84b94d-9c07-4bf7-82a0-5e6bbadcaff9","number":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"id":"47c06ee5-9629-4490-a235-e0b0356076d4","number":"10","title":"Chapter 10","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"id":"7735a71c-e272-4ae8-b6ca-1ba2e2b2f2b3","number":"9","title":"Chapter 9","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"7bb8a2d8-ea40-4eaf-9d9d-631227bb6541","number":"8","title":"Chapter 8","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"id":"2bd4f3bf-3667-465c-986b-ee0c49d3cf4c","number":"7","title":"Chapter 7","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"id":"c22764e1-c675-4fdd-9a5f-e3f9cda1768f","number":"6","title":"Chapter 6","date":"2026-06-20","images":[]},{"id":"2a879a41-a620-4e5e-9741-2f2d4f802386","number":"5","title":"Chapter 5","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"cdfcf1c5-6ce3-40a6-963c-60ab354251aa","number":"4","title":"Chapter 4","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"f78b77fa-2d97-4b70-8a8f-0f3ea40b2c75","number":"3","title":"Chapter 3","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"7c688231-a388-47d0-8073-7a560c59ef98","number":"2","title":"Chapter 2","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"5726cc5d-1bf9-4639-9ffa-e22f66f59f6b","number":"1","title":"Chapter 